item.description:
Forget the midterms — the votes are in for the new voice of Boston’s Logan Airport. Find out why college students across the country are partying with self-care in mind. As birdwatching booms among Gen Z, research suggests it could be an investment in your brain health. After a lifetime of medical challenges, Olivia DeKold found relief through an unusual intestinal procedure and a reason to believe in her future again. Plus,&nbsp;meet the New York City teen taking a unique approach to choosing a career.&nbsp;

Host/Producer: Krista Bo Polanco&nbsp;

Producer: Eryn Mathewson&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin&nbsp;

Editorial Support: Daria Casalini, Julia Vargas Jones&nbsp;
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

